  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "This is Nancy Dickerson, NBC News. I need two minutes of your time.\n\r\nI
    want to make sure you understand what you're dealing with out on that convention
    floor, because the mood in this country has shifted. Since Tet, the antiwar protests
    have gone nationwide. New York, Chicago, college campuses across the country
    \u2014 thousands of people in the streets. Sit-ins, teach-ins, marches. And every
    night, the American public is watching the war come into their living rooms on
    television \u2014 burning villages, wounded soldiers, families grieving. The
    anger is real, and it is growing.\n\r\nI spoke with the President this morning.
    He's worried about Congress \u2014 he told me the pressure to cut commitments
    is coming from inside his own party now, not just the Republicans. He doesn't
    know how much longer he can hold the caucus together on this."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 32091826b8c824c4980c24d53d802587, type: 2}
