  m_text: "Use the 15 allocators dispersed across three locations to choose how to
    prioritize your funds. At each location, there will be places available to use
    sliders or input specific values in order to allocate your $200 million dollar
    budget. Entering and exiting these rooms will preserve the values of your allocated
    funds, and can be altered before they are finalized. \r\n\r\nExplore the spaces\u2026
    some things you see may encourage further investigation. Clickable objects that
    allow you to move closer within an area will change color upon hovering your
    mouse over the object. Other items may glow with light, and clicking on them
    may provide you with useful information. When you are done, click \u201CDecide\u201D
    to finalize your choices and view the results of your decision. \r\n"
